msgid "JobBoard may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms, threaten platform security, or engage in fraudulent activity. Users may request account closure via the contact channels provided."
msgstr "JobBoard may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms, threaten platform security, or engage in fraudulent activity. Users may request account closure via the contact channels provided."

